      "sent_id": "fin7_fact_sheet_how_fin7_attached_and_stole_data_0_sent_0",
      "text": "HOW FIN7 ATTACKED AND STOLE DATA Sophisticated Social Engineering: Phishing & Calling FIN7 typically initiated its cyberattacks by delivering a 'phishing' email to a company employee.",
      "hits": [
