    {
      "sent_id": "fin7_fact_sheet_how_fin7_attached_and_stole_data_0_sent_1",
      "text": "The text within the email simulated a legitimate businessrelated message in order to lead the recipient employee to open the attachment and unwittingly activate the malware that would infect the compu",
