    {
      "sent_id": "fin7_fact_sheet_how_fin7_attached_and_stole_data_0_sent_2",
      "text": "For example, when targeting a hotel chain, the sender of the phishing email might claim to be interested in making a reservation with details enclosed in the attachment.",
